stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Nominal
    Nominal --> Anomaly: detector fires
    Anomaly --> Hypotheses: build posterior over causes
    Hypotheses --> Test: belief uncertain, budget remains
    Hypotheses --> Act: one cause confident
    Test --> Hypotheses: fold result into posterior
    Act --> Verify: watch recovery window
    Verify --> Nominal: link restored
    Verify --> Hypotheses: no recovery, budget remains
    Hypotheses --> Failsafe: refusal criteria met
    Verify --> Failsafe: budget or timeout exhausted
    Failsafe --> [*]: declare_link_lost plus RTH
